{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名民主黨議員在這場英偉達風波中，交易時機恰好站在了有利一側。<strong>追蹤國會議員股票交易的平台數據顯示，加州民主黨眾議員羅·坎納及其配偶，在英偉達股價接近高點時減持了英偉達股票。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586170.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:42.166300+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:33:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:00.124950+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:00.124950+00:00","content_hash":"dce2a1f0f1d91bbda6968362c0f09ef9ba7043f5b2771d78d5d5bb2f8845ee96","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}